<title>USA: UNR to sell assets of home products unit.</title>
<headline>UNR to sell assets of home products unit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNR Industries Inc said Tuesday it agreed to sell assets of its home products division to Franke Inc for $21.4 million cash.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close in September or October.</p>
<p>UNR said the sale is part of a restructuring program announced on January 26.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope to announce the sale of our Real Time Solutions Inc subsidiary before year end,&quot; said the company's president, Thomas Gildenhaus.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
